  "comment": "C&C Red Alert 2. With NO_CNCNET set to a yes value, use cnc-ddraw (rename the game ddraw.dll once, install cnc_ddraw). Otherwise install the CnCNet launcher (cncnet_ra2) and start it instead of the game; when that verb could not be installed, fall back to cnc-ddraw like upstream does. Steps rely on per-step evaluation of `when`: the fallback runs only when cncnet_ra2 is still not installed after its own step. The ddraw.dll rename comes before the cnc_ddraw verb so that the verb step does not hide it.",
  "confidence": "medium: upstream lower-cases NO_CNCNET; only the lower-case spellings are matched here.",
  "steps": [
